        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fuel elements PWR, UO2 4.2% centrifuge &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fuel elements PWR, UO2 4.2% centrifuge &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant
The shares are based on the real total energy that will be obtained by MOX fuels in current Swiss PWRs over their entire lifetime. This module belongs to the chain with enrichment from centrifuge only. Hence, the indication of data validity inputted in "TimePeriod" only says that the shares represent the knowledge available today of the fuel management for the Swiss PWRs.;
UUID: 78c59748-2056-30cf-bc41-efa7d49b4e7c
The module consists of the share of UO2 and MOX fuel elements.
Location: Hypothetical use of centrifuge enrichment only, for the Swiss PWRs
Technology: Data reflects the use of UO2 and MOX fuel elements in current nuclear reactors.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78c59748-2056-30cf-bc41-efa7d49b4e7c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
